<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادی کبریٰ (ص)/فاطمہ کبریٰ دخترِ شبیر</div>
Fatima kubra duqtar e shabbir<br>
Qush huwi thi ke ho gayi dilgeer<br>
Aqd ke din ulat gayi taqdeer<br>
Teri shaadi hai qoon se tehreer<br>
<br>
Shaad maani na kuch qushi dekhi<br>
Gham se bharpoor zindagi dekhi<br>
<br>
Tu ne shadi me fatima kubra<br>
Sath jodou ke ek randsaala<br>
Sab se pehle jahez me paya<br>
Kya bayaa'n ho bhala tere gham ka<br>
<br>
Gham ki tamheed ban gayi shadi<br>
Kya niraali huwi teri shadi<br>
<br>
Aye shahe karbala ki shehzaadi<br>
Thi ye shaadi ke teri barbaadi<br>
Gham ka unwaa'n bani teri shadi<br>
Teri qismat hai tujh pe faryaadi<br>
<br>
Kamsini me naseeb phoot gaya<br>
Tujh pe gham ka pahaad toot gaya<br>
<br>
Tu ne pehna dulhan ka tha joda<br>
Ya ke pehna tha tu ne randsala<br>
Chand lamho me haye kya ye huwa<br>
Uth gaya sar se saaya waris ka<br>
<br>
Dulha ran me jo mar gaya tera<br>
Sar se ghungat utar gaya saara<br>
<br>
Tere qaime me jab ke aag lagi<br>
Jal gaya hujla e uroosi bhi<br>
Kya batau ke kaisi loot machi<br>
Sar se chadar bhi chin gayi teri<br>
<br>
Dil me armaan ghut gaye saare<br>
Tere zewar bhi lut gaye saare<br>
<br>
Ran se dulha ki laash jab aayi<br>
Tere chehre pe bewagi chaayi<br>
Tu na fart e hayaa se ro paayi<br>
Tujh ko taqdeer din ye dikhlaayi<br>
<br>
Nousha e paash paash ke tukde<br>
Tu ne dekhe hai laash ke tukde<br>
<br>
Fatima kubra aye aseer e mehan<br>
Tujh ko bewa kahu mai ya ke dulhan <br>
Cheen kar tere hathou se kangan<br>
Baandhi thi zalimou ne kas ke rasan<br>
<br>
Zaqm par zaqm tujhko milte the<br>
Tere pohnche rasan se chilte the<br>
<br>
Taaziyane wo pusht par khaana<br>
Aisi haalat me dil ko samjhana<br>
Muh ka baalou se parda farmaana<br>
Tera darbaare shaam me jaana<br>
<br>
Yaad jis waqt humko aata hai<br>
Qoo'n ke aansu hame rulata hai<br>
<br>
Teri shadi ka gham hai taaza jo<br>
Hai aqeedat ki intehaa ye to<br>
Aaj tak saatwi moharram ko<br>
Kaale kapde pehan ke sab dekho<br>
<br>
Sar pe mehndi utha ke laate hai<br>
Teri shadi me rone aate hai<br>
<br>
Zindagi bhar uthaye tu ne mehan<br>
Apne dulha ko de saki na kafan<br>
Tera ghurbat me ban gaya madfan<br>
Peet kar sar padho ye bait hassan<br>
<br>
Seh ke sadme guzar gayi haye haye<br>
Fatima kubra mar gayi haye haye